WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:37.840
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:37.920 --> 01:40.800
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

02:01.400 --> 02:02.600
Changheng.

02:03.800 --> 02:05.000
Go back.

02:06.160 --> 02:07.760
I'm afraid that I can't do it.

02:12.440 --> 02:14.960
You ignored the restraining order
again and again.

02:15.040 --> 02:16.600
Who are you doing this for?

02:17.640 --> 02:18.840
Orchid.

02:20.040 --> 02:22.120
Do you really love her?

02:22.200 --> 02:23.320
Yes.

03:08.640 --> 03:11.400
I just want to save the one I love.

03:11.480 --> 03:13.000
What's wrong with that?

03:13.720 --> 03:15.680
Sinner Changheng.

03:15.760 --> 03:17.840
You broke through the Spirit Lock Gate,

03:17.920 --> 03:20.240
committed a crime of collusion

03:20.320 --> 03:22.720
and violated the immortal rules.

03:22.800 --> 03:25.200
You are deprived of the title
of the God of War

03:26.200 --> 03:28.280
and will be imprisoned
in the Haotian Tower.

03:48.960 --> 03:49.920
Who is it?

03:52.600 --> 03:54.560
Black Dragon, I'm no stranger.

03:54.640 --> 03:55.680
What do you mean by that?

03:56.400 --> 03:57.600
It's already midnight.

03:58.320 --> 03:59.960
Why are you sneaking around here?

04:00.040 --> 04:02.280
It's nothing. I'm leaving now.

04:02.360 --> 04:03.480
Stop!

04:07.400 --> 04:08.320
Tell me.

04:09.840 --> 04:11.760
Why are you wandering
in the middle of the night?

04:13.480 --> 04:14.400
What do you want?

04:14.480 --> 04:16.160
Nothing.

04:16.240 --> 04:17.360
Tell me.

04:21.360 --> 04:23.040
What do I want?

04:23.680 --> 04:25.800
I almost died during the day.

04:26.440 --> 04:28.200
I'm just too scared to sleep at night.

04:30.320 --> 04:31.800
I'm a woman.

04:31.880 --> 04:33.680
I lost my parents when I was young.

04:33.760 --> 04:36.200
I finally saved up some money
and opened a shop.

04:36.280 --> 04:38.320
And I was cheated by Orchid.

04:39.040 --> 04:41.560
That's why I came to her.
I wanted to make a living.

04:42.560 --> 04:43.880
I didn't expect

04:43.960 --> 04:46.440
that everyone here would want to kill me.

04:47.800 --> 04:49.800
What have I done wrong?

04:52.640 --> 04:53.840
You're an orphan too?

04:55.600 --> 04:56.480
"Too"?

04:57.560 --> 04:58.560
You too?

05:03.520 --> 05:04.520
I'm telling you.

05:04.600 --> 05:07.120
I really thought
I wouldn't be able to escape.

05:07.200 --> 05:09.440
I would have been skinned
and made into a scarf by them.

05:09.520 --> 05:11.200
What happened next?

05:11.280 --> 05:12.200
Next?

05:13.200 --> 05:15.080
Luckily, I was smart.

05:15.160 --> 05:17.080
I pretended to be fooled by them

05:17.160 --> 05:18.680
and pretended to behave.

05:18.760 --> 05:22.000
Then I drugged their food
and made them vomit

05:22.080 --> 05:23.480
for three days and nights.

05:24.040 --> 05:26.120
Then I ran away.

05:28.200 --> 05:29.200
Actually,

05:30.000 --> 05:31.400
I was like you when I was young.

05:32.520 --> 05:33.920
I had no parents

05:34.000 --> 05:35.080
and wandered around.

05:35.640 --> 05:37.240
Everyone pretended to be nice to me

05:37.320 --> 05:38.800
and pretended to take me in.

05:39.600 --> 05:42.160
But all they wanted were
my dragon bone and skin to make medicine.

05:43.880 --> 05:45.200
Later,

05:45.280 --> 05:46.960
I was fortunately saved by my lord.

05:47.840 --> 05:50.160
Otherwise, I would be dead by now.

05:54.160 --> 05:55.000
Black Dragon,

05:55.880 --> 05:57.160
don't be sad.

05:57.720 --> 05:59.080
That's how people are.

05:59.160 --> 06:01.520
You can't believe what they say.

06:01.600 --> 06:04.200
They could sell their parents and children

06:04.280 --> 06:05.680
for money and benefits.

06:05.760 --> 06:07.120
Let alone people like us

06:07.200 --> 06:09.120
who have no one to rely on.

06:10.160 --> 06:11.320
So…

06:11.400 --> 06:12.880
I made up my mind then.

06:12.960 --> 06:15.640
I will never be like those who bullied me,

06:15.720 --> 06:17.920
full of lies and scheming.

06:19.360 --> 06:20.760
I swear

06:20.840 --> 06:23.560
I will be the most trustworthy
and the most honest person

06:23.640 --> 06:24.680
in the world.

06:29.200 --> 06:30.320
Why are you laughing?

06:31.320 --> 06:32.880
Because you are so stupid.

06:34.520 --> 06:36.360
Black Dragon,

06:36.440 --> 06:37.800
what's wrong with you?

06:37.880 --> 06:40.280
You were bullied and suffered so much,

06:40.360 --> 06:42.680
yet you still want to be
the most honest person.

06:42.760 --> 06:45.840
Even if you do,
people will trample on your sincerity.

06:45.920 --> 06:48.080
How can you be so cold-blooded?

06:48.160 --> 06:49.640
I'm cold-blooded?

06:51.720 --> 06:54.520
Yes, I'm cold-blooded and heartless.

06:54.600 --> 06:56.560
I'm not that lucky. No one saved me.

06:56.640 --> 06:59.080
I've been saving myself since I was a kid.

06:59.880 --> 07:02.280
So I trust no one except myself.

07:02.360 --> 07:05.000
Besides, instead of being cheated,

07:05.080 --> 07:06.760
I'd rather cheat others.

07:08.040 --> 07:09.440
In this world,

07:09.520 --> 07:11.920
there's nothing more important

07:12.000 --> 07:13.800
besides my life and money.

07:17.720 --> 07:21.120
You are absolutely wrong and ridiculous.

07:21.800 --> 07:24.280
There is no right or wrong in this world.

07:24.840 --> 07:26.240
All people are selfish.

07:26.320 --> 07:28.160
- You--
- I'd like to say you're ridiculous

07:28.240 --> 07:29.400
and absolutely wrong!

07:30.680 --> 07:32.280
It's a waste of my time talking

07:32.360 --> 07:33.800
to a scheming person like you.

07:33.880 --> 07:34.960
Go back to your room.

07:35.760 --> 07:38.160
Don't let me see you wandering
in the middle of the night.

07:38.240 --> 07:39.640
If I see you again,

07:39.720 --> 07:40.880
you will be severely punished.

07:42.960 --> 07:43.920
Go.

07:45.400 --> 07:46.320
Fine.

08:10.760 --> 08:11.640
My lord.

08:14.120 --> 08:15.080
My lord.

08:18.840 --> 08:20.840
How is Jieli now?

08:22.200 --> 08:23.320
My lord,

08:23.400 --> 08:25.080
Jieli has escaped
to the Silent Moon Palace.

08:25.160 --> 08:27.160
I ordered someone to watch
outside the palace.

08:27.880 --> 08:29.440
As soon as she leaves the palace,

08:29.520 --> 08:30.800
we will catch her.

08:33.960 --> 08:34.919
Got it.

08:48.400 --> 08:49.680
Jieli.

08:51.320 --> 08:52.560
Jieli.

08:57.160 --> 08:58.880
Jieli.

08:59.600 --> 09:02.840
The best and the most beautiful woman
in the three realms.

09:02.920 --> 09:05.840
Don't be angry, all right?

09:05.920 --> 09:06.920
Jieli.

09:07.000 --> 09:08.960
I know I was wrong.

09:10.840 --> 09:12.240
Leave me alone.

09:12.320 --> 09:14.520
Don't talk to me.

09:14.600 --> 09:16.200
I'm afraid you'll cheat me again.

09:24.720 --> 09:25.600
Jieli.

09:26.080 --> 09:27.160
This is for you.

09:28.960 --> 09:30.280
No.

09:30.360 --> 09:33.200
I'll be killed. I don't need treasures.

09:33.760 --> 09:35.640
This is not an ordinary treasure.

09:35.720 --> 09:37.280
It can help you escape from the palace.

09:42.760 --> 09:43.760
It's called Bone Orchid.

09:43.840 --> 09:46.440
Dongfang Qingcang is afraid of mishaps
before I fix the Destiny Book.

09:46.520 --> 09:48.520
So he gave it to me to protect me.

09:48.600 --> 09:50.920
It's transformed
from the blood of his heart.

09:51.000 --> 09:52.720
It is equivalent to the Moon Supreme.

09:52.800 --> 09:53.720
I'll lend it to you.

09:53.800 --> 09:56.360
When you leave the palace,
no one will dare to stop you.

09:56.440 --> 09:57.440
Really?

09:58.560 --> 10:00.440
You'll lend such an important thing to me

10:00.520 --> 10:02.080
for nothing?

10:02.160 --> 10:03.440
Of course.

10:03.520 --> 10:04.920
We are friends.

10:05.000 --> 10:06.600
No, we are not.

10:07.160 --> 10:08.360
Don't try to get close to me.

10:10.960 --> 10:12.600
Are you trying
to deny the debt you owe me?

10:13.280 --> 10:15.080
Jieli, I know you look tough,

10:15.160 --> 10:16.280
but you are soft-hearted.

10:16.360 --> 10:18.000
You are mean

10:18.080 --> 10:20.080
- but you are actually--
- Enough.

10:20.160 --> 10:22.080
You make me sick. Let's go.

10:22.160 --> 10:23.560
Wait. You go.

10:23.640 --> 10:24.760
I can't leave.

10:24.840 --> 10:26.360
I promised Dongfang Qingcang

10:26.440 --> 10:28.040
to help him fix the Seven Emotions Tree.

10:28.120 --> 10:29.640
I can't go back on my word.

10:29.720 --> 10:31.920
You'd better fix your brain first.

10:32.000 --> 10:34.440
After I die, they will kill you next.

10:34.520 --> 10:36.440
I will be fine.

10:37.000 --> 10:39.040
No. You have to send me out.

10:39.120 --> 10:41.440
I'm afraid this treasure
is not as useful as you.

10:41.520 --> 10:42.960
Everyone in the palace

10:43.040 --> 10:44.840
has to find favor with you.

10:44.920 --> 10:47.120
You must at least send me out
of Ninth You.

10:51.120 --> 10:51.960
Fine.

10:52.520 --> 10:53.840
Let's go.

10:54.400 --> 10:55.360
Wait.

10:57.280 --> 10:58.960
What now?

10:59.040 --> 11:01.600
Dongfang Qingcang is connected
to my mind now.

11:01.680 --> 11:03.360
What if he doesn't wear the You Jade Ring?

11:03.440 --> 11:04.520
I'm timid.

11:04.600 --> 11:06.680
He will feel me when I'm nervous.

11:07.480 --> 11:08.800
I'm with you.

11:08.880 --> 11:10.240
I'll get you into trouble.

11:10.320 --> 11:12.320
Leave by yourself.

11:12.400 --> 11:13.400
That's easy.

11:16.240 --> 11:18.560
This is my treasure.

11:18.640 --> 11:20.960
It is unique in all of the three realms.

11:21.040 --> 11:22.400
Put it on.

11:22.480 --> 11:24.640
The Moon Supreme will not feel you again.

11:27.200 --> 11:29.600
This is just an ordinary hairpin.

11:29.680 --> 11:31.360
It doesn't even have pearl ornaments.

11:31.440 --> 11:32.920
What's so special about it?

11:33.000 --> 11:34.240
You know nothing.

11:34.320 --> 11:36.280
This is not an ordinary hairpin.

11:36.360 --> 11:37.920
This is a Heart-Hiding Hairpin.

11:38.920 --> 11:42.520
The ancestor of the Moon Tribe, Lady Yan
and the ancestor of the fairies, Chonghua,

11:42.600 --> 11:44.120
were in love with each other back then.

11:44.200 --> 11:45.200
But later,

11:45.280 --> 11:47.680
the Moon Tribe was betrayed
and expelled by the fairies.

11:47.760 --> 11:49.920
Lady Yan was so sad
and broke up with Chonghua.

11:50.000 --> 11:53.560
So she decided not to let her lover
feel her feelings

11:53.640 --> 11:55.680
and made this Heart-Hiding Hairpin.

11:56.920 --> 11:58.440
It's an ancient treasure?

11:59.000 --> 12:00.040
Of course.

12:00.120 --> 12:02.480
Except for You Jade Ring,
the Moon Tribe's sacred treasure,

12:02.560 --> 12:04.480
this is the only treasure
that can hide your mind

12:04.560 --> 12:05.640
in the three realms.

12:05.720 --> 12:06.760
When you wear it,

12:06.840 --> 12:08.840
everything you think
will be locked in the hairpin.

12:08.920 --> 12:10.840
No matter how powerful the opponents are,

12:10.920 --> 12:12.320
they can't sense anything.

12:13.040 --> 12:14.120
This treasure

12:14.200 --> 12:16.160
can deal with your One Heart Curse.

12:16.240 --> 12:17.080
Put it on.

12:25.320 --> 12:27.040
To be clear,

12:27.120 --> 12:29.080
I'm just lending it to you for a while.

12:29.160 --> 12:31.680
When you get out,
you must return it to me immediately.

12:32.480 --> 12:33.320
Let's go.

12:44.040 --> 12:45.080
The sky.

12:46.000 --> 12:46.840
The earth.

12:48.520 --> 12:50.000
The air smells of freedom.

12:51.600 --> 12:53.200
You're good.

12:53.280 --> 12:55.000
The guards let you go

12:55.080 --> 12:56.520
when they see you.

12:56.600 --> 12:57.760
You have no idea.

12:57.840 --> 12:59.520
I was so nervous just now.

12:59.600 --> 13:01.360
Luckily, I have your Heart-Hiding Hairpin.

13:01.440 --> 13:02.480
Let's go.

13:03.840 --> 13:05.040
Hush.

13:18.000 --> 13:19.440
She is from Haishi.

13:26.120 --> 13:27.080
Take this.

13:27.160 --> 13:28.480
It can protect you.

13:37.000 --> 13:38.200
Go.

13:39.960 --> 13:42.360
I took the Destiny Book.
It has nothing to do with Jieli.

13:42.440 --> 13:43.840
Just come at me.

13:57.360 --> 13:59.360
What are you waiting for? Run!

14:19.080 --> 14:20.360
It's the fairy.

14:21.240 --> 14:22.760
My lord!

14:22.840 --> 14:24.960
Please save Orchid.
People from Haishi are…

14:44.360 --> 14:45.360
The Destiny Book.

15:03.320 --> 15:04.520
Lord Changheng.

15:21.280 --> 15:22.360
You're awake.

15:22.440 --> 15:23.520
How do you feel?

15:26.120 --> 15:27.000
Lord…

15:28.720 --> 15:29.800
Lord Changheng.

15:29.880 --> 15:31.920
- I didn't--
- I told you

15:32.000 --> 15:33.400
I would take you back to Shuiyuntian.

15:34.600 --> 15:36.120
Shuiyuntian?

15:36.200 --> 15:37.040
What?

15:37.120 --> 15:39.120
Don't you recognize the Arbiter Hall
you used to live in?

15:42.040 --> 15:43.120
Arbiter Hall?

15:44.400 --> 15:46.320
I'm back to the real Arbiter Hall.

15:46.400 --> 15:48.320
Yes. You're home.

15:49.440 --> 15:50.960
By the way, Lord Changheng.

15:51.040 --> 15:53.160
A Destiny Book was robbed
by someone from Haishi.

15:55.840 --> 15:57.240
Is this

15:57.320 --> 15:58.600
what you are talking about?

15:59.240 --> 16:00.120
Yes.

16:01.000 --> 16:02.080
This Destiny Book

16:02.160 --> 16:03.760
is very important.

16:03.840 --> 16:05.680
Fortunately, you got it.

16:05.760 --> 16:06.920
Important?

16:08.560 --> 16:11.280
Dongfang Qingcang took me to Cangyan Sea

16:11.360 --> 16:13.040
and did not hurt me.

16:13.120 --> 16:15.160
It's not because
I'm a spy of the Moon Tribe,

16:15.240 --> 16:17.800
but because he wanted me
to fix the Destiny Book.

16:17.880 --> 16:19.480
My lord, please check it.

16:19.560 --> 16:21.080
What's the mystery behind it?

16:21.160 --> 16:24.000
Why do the people of Haishi
and Dongfang Qingcang all want it?

16:24.080 --> 16:26.360
This Destiny Book has been destroyed.
I can't figure it out.

16:27.000 --> 16:28.840
We need to fix it to find out the truth.

16:28.920 --> 16:30.280
I'll fix it now.

16:30.360 --> 16:31.320
No hurry.

16:31.400 --> 16:32.520
You just got hurt.

16:32.600 --> 16:34.000
Don't use your power.

16:34.080 --> 16:35.320
Take a rest.

16:36.040 --> 16:37.040
I'm fine.

16:37.120 --> 16:39.360
The sooner I fix it
and figure out the truth,

16:39.440 --> 16:41.360
the sooner I can prove that I'm not a spy

16:41.440 --> 16:43.000
and didn't betray Shuiyuntian.

17:31.920 --> 17:36.840
ARBITER HALL

18:10.680 --> 18:11.840
My lord, how is it?

18:11.920 --> 18:13.480
She is fixing it.

18:14.920 --> 18:16.120
The fairy and the Destiny Book

18:16.200 --> 18:17.880
have fallen into our hands.

18:17.960 --> 18:19.720
Why bother to disguise

18:19.800 --> 18:20.960
as Changheng?

18:22.600 --> 18:25.480
If I didn't pretend
to be someone she cares about

18:25.560 --> 18:27.800
and coax her to fix it willingly,

18:28.720 --> 18:30.520
she would rather die than fix it.

18:30.600 --> 18:32.560
It will be a waste of time.

18:50.800 --> 18:52.720
My lord, Dongfang Qingcang is here.

18:54.240 --> 18:55.200
So soon?

18:55.280 --> 18:57.200
We are no match for him.
You should leave first--

18:57.280 --> 18:58.320
No.

18:59.200 --> 19:00.760
Everything is going well.

19:01.520 --> 19:03.080
We can't make any mistakes.

19:03.160 --> 19:04.240
But…

19:04.320 --> 19:05.920
The Destiny Book is not fixed yet.

19:06.000 --> 19:07.960
We can't let the fairy find out
she has been cheated.

19:08.040 --> 19:09.080
Take some men

19:09.160 --> 19:11.120
to stop him at all costs.

19:11.200 --> 19:12.080
Yes.

19:22.280 --> 19:23.320
Hand her over.

19:23.880 --> 19:25.400
Who are you talking about?

19:26.400 --> 19:27.920
We don't have who you are looking for.

19:51.280 --> 19:52.280
How long will it take?

19:53.240 --> 19:54.160
Soon.

21:13.480 --> 21:16.160
THOUSAND DREAMLAND

21:57.240 --> 21:59.160
This is an illusion.

21:59.720 --> 22:01.320
There are endless changes.

22:02.080 --> 22:03.960
If you want to break it with power,

22:04.040 --> 22:05.920
you'll only fall into it.

22:07.280 --> 22:08.600
Moon Supreme Lord.

22:09.080 --> 22:11.160
Even if you are powerful,

22:11.720 --> 22:13.720
you won't find

22:14.880 --> 22:17.280
that fairy.

22:21.920 --> 22:23.320
It's just a trick.

22:23.400 --> 22:25.160
How long can you hold me?

22:30.680 --> 22:32.120
A moment is enough.

22:58.360 --> 23:00.040
"Xie Wanqing."

23:00.120 --> 23:01.760
It's a mortal's name.

23:08.960 --> 23:12.160
This festival celebrates
the Fairy Tribe's victory

23:12.240 --> 23:13.800
in the Battle of Two Tribes.

23:13.880 --> 23:15.760
Shuiyuntian celebrates
the victory of the battle

23:15.840 --> 23:18.000
and the sealing of Moon Supreme

23:18.080 --> 23:19.600
on that day.

23:35.040 --> 23:36.000
Are you done?

23:38.920 --> 23:39.840
Yes.

23:40.760 --> 23:42.520
Thank you. Give it to me.

23:48.560 --> 23:49.680
Lord Changheng.

23:50.440 --> 23:52.240
After you left Cangyan Sea,

23:52.320 --> 23:53.840
you sent the fireflies to look for me.

23:53.920 --> 23:57.320
But I was locked up by Dongfang Qingcang.

23:57.400 --> 23:58.800
He didn't allow me to reply.

23:58.880 --> 24:01.680
Are you mad at me?

24:05.960 --> 24:07.040
No.

24:09.600 --> 24:12.520
I'm just worried about you.

24:20.240 --> 24:22.880
Orchid, you want to run?

24:25.240 --> 24:26.960
You're not Lord Changheng.

24:27.040 --> 24:28.200
Who are you?

24:31.400 --> 24:33.120
I didn't expect

24:33.200 --> 24:34.680
that you could see through me.

24:39.120 --> 24:42.760
This is an illusion.

24:42.840 --> 24:45.360
I made the Arbiter Hall with my mind.

24:45.440 --> 24:47.000
You can't escape.

24:47.480 --> 24:49.760
Give me the Destiny Book.

25:58.880 --> 25:59.920
Dongfang Qingcang.

26:00.000 --> 26:01.040
He came to save me.

26:01.840 --> 26:02.960
Save you?

26:03.760 --> 26:05.560
He just wants the Destiny Book.

26:08.880 --> 26:09.880
I…

26:18.520 --> 26:19.440
It's you.

26:19.520 --> 26:20.760
You came to save me.

26:21.320 --> 26:22.400
How dare you

26:25.080 --> 26:26.520
capture my people?

26:31.440 --> 26:32.280
That's impossible.

26:32.360 --> 26:34.600
You can't find this place
in such a short time.

27:03.600 --> 27:04.560
Who are you?

27:05.040 --> 27:06.640
Why do you need the Destiny Book?

27:10.360 --> 27:11.960
Since you won't tell me,

27:12.800 --> 27:14.400
I'll find out myself.

28:06.120 --> 28:08.760
It seems that we've escaped
from this fish tank…

28:16.200 --> 28:17.600
Wait for me.

28:23.360 --> 28:24.960
Moon Supreme, wait for me.

28:25.040 --> 28:27.520
- Thank you for saving me.
- Why did you run away?

28:28.360 --> 28:29.440
I told you

28:29.520 --> 28:30.920
not to leave my sight.

28:31.000 --> 28:32.360
You have such weak power.

28:32.440 --> 28:33.600
If I were late today,

28:33.680 --> 28:34.920
you would have died!

28:35.680 --> 28:37.280
I didn't run away.

28:37.360 --> 28:39.520
I promised you
to fix the Seven Emotions Tree.

28:39.600 --> 28:40.760
I will keep my promise.

28:40.840 --> 28:41.880
I won't run away.

28:41.960 --> 28:43.400
I just want to help Jieli.

28:43.480 --> 28:44.720
I don't care.

28:44.800 --> 28:46.120
I'll say it again.

28:46.200 --> 28:48.920
From now on, you need to stay in my sight.

28:49.000 --> 28:51.600
No matter where you are going,
you have to let me know. Got it?

28:54.080 --> 28:54.960
Yes.

30:05.880 --> 30:07.600
The fog and snow are gone.

30:11.440 --> 30:12.520
I see.

30:12.600 --> 30:16.200
Because the Soul Transformation Cauldron
refined evil qi every day,

30:16.280 --> 30:18.520
the grief and despair of the deceased

30:18.600 --> 30:19.760
can't disperse.

30:20.800 --> 30:22.720
That's why there was fog and snow

30:22.800 --> 30:24.920
in Haishi.

30:25.000 --> 30:26.480
Now that you've broken the cauldron,

30:26.560 --> 30:28.080
the fog disappeared.

30:28.160 --> 30:29.280
That's great.

30:38.880 --> 30:40.360
Moon Supreme.

30:40.440 --> 30:41.920
I'm fine

30:42.000 --> 30:44.440
and the Destiny Book is here.

30:44.520 --> 30:46.760
It's not only that, but I also fixed it.

30:46.840 --> 30:47.680
Look.

30:50.120 --> 30:51.280
Take a look.

30:51.800 --> 30:52.880
Look.

30:59.200 --> 31:00.400
It's really fixed?

31:00.920 --> 31:03.960
Yes. Didn't you want me to fix it?

31:04.040 --> 31:06.280
How is it? Are you happy?

31:07.360 --> 31:09.280
Why did you fix it so fast this time?

31:10.400 --> 31:11.480
I…

31:11.960 --> 31:14.680
I just wanted to share

31:14.760 --> 31:16.120
- your burden.
- Tell me the truth.

31:20.560 --> 31:21.960
Lord of Haishi

31:22.040 --> 31:23.880
was too cunning.

31:23.960 --> 31:26.160
He pretended to be Lord Changheng

31:26.240 --> 31:28.040
and asked me to fix the Destiny Book.

31:31.840 --> 31:34.120
When I asked you to fix it,

31:34.200 --> 31:35.480
you gave all kinds of excuses.

31:36.400 --> 31:38.760
You were quite motivated
when you met Changheng.

31:40.360 --> 31:42.280
Moon Supreme, listen to me.

31:42.360 --> 31:43.240
Listen to me.

31:43.320 --> 31:46.960
Do you know
how I saw through the illusion?

31:47.040 --> 31:49.720
Do you remember
when you lived in the Arbiter Hall,

31:49.800 --> 31:51.280
you broke my wooden stand?

31:51.360 --> 31:54.000
But the wooden stand in this illusion
was intact.

31:54.080 --> 31:55.040
That's why

31:55.120 --> 31:57.320
I saw through his scheme.

31:57.880 --> 32:01.000
It's because only the two of us
know about this.

32:08.560 --> 32:09.520
By the way,

32:09.600 --> 32:11.080
the Lord of Haishi said

32:11.160 --> 32:13.160
there were thousands of illusions

32:13.240 --> 32:15.720
and thousands of me.

32:15.800 --> 32:18.360
How did you find me so soon?

32:24.520 --> 32:26.440
Let alone these illusions,

32:27.200 --> 32:29.960
even if he put you

32:30.040 --> 32:32.080
in thousands of identical orchids,

32:32.160 --> 32:34.160
I will find you in an instant.

32:42.160 --> 32:44.080
So don't run away again.

32:44.640 --> 32:46.320
Even at the end of the Oblivion River

32:46.400 --> 32:47.920
and the edge of the world,

32:48.000 --> 32:49.760
I can still find you.

32:50.440 --> 32:51.640
Understand?

32:56.480 --> 32:57.320
You…

32:58.560 --> 33:00.120
Why are you crying again?

33:01.120 --> 33:02.840
I'm so happy.

33:03.520 --> 33:04.440
Back then,

33:04.520 --> 33:07.160
my master said the same thing to me.

33:08.320 --> 33:10.000
My master was

33:10.080 --> 33:11.880
the dearest and most important person

33:11.960 --> 33:13.360
to me.

33:14.080 --> 33:15.520
And you…

33:38.840 --> 33:43.800
SPIRIT-SHATTERING ABYSS, XISHAN

34:22.080 --> 34:24.040
My lord was badly injured.

34:24.120 --> 34:25.679
I came here

34:26.239 --> 34:28.679
to ask for help from Evil God.

34:43.800 --> 34:45.719
He's protected by the evil qi.

34:46.639 --> 34:47.920
Who can hurt him?

34:48.000 --> 34:49.320
Dongfang Qingcang.

34:50.360 --> 34:52.679
Dongfang Qingcang?

34:55.440 --> 34:57.600
I thought I wouldn't have any opponent

34:57.680 --> 34:59.680
in the three realms after Taiyi.

35:00.440 --> 35:02.280
Now it seems

35:03.040 --> 35:04.880
quite interesting.

35:26.480 --> 35:27.720
Thank you for saving me.

35:32.320 --> 35:33.360
Don't worry.

35:34.840 --> 35:35.720
I…

35:37.400 --> 35:39.920
I've found the reincarnation
of the fairy, Xiyun.

35:40.400 --> 35:41.480
Soon,

35:41.560 --> 35:43.520
she will be brought
to the Spirit-Shattering Abyss

35:43.600 --> 35:46.480
and help you break the realm.

35:55.960 --> 36:00.480
DARK PINE FOREST, CANGYAN SEA

36:36.240 --> 36:37.400
Where is this place?

36:39.080 --> 36:40.320
A hunting camp.

36:50.080 --> 36:52.800
Why are all the hunters here women?

36:52.880 --> 36:55.200
There aren't many men here.

37:03.760 --> 37:05.120
Are you still angry?

37:07.200 --> 37:08.080
No.

37:09.120 --> 37:10.680
Yes, you are.

37:18.320 --> 37:19.600
Big Blockhead,

37:19.680 --> 37:21.280
I know I was wrong.

37:21.360 --> 37:23.400
I won't run around anymore.

37:23.480 --> 37:25.400
No matter where I go,

37:25.480 --> 37:27.520
I will tell you, all right?

37:38.520 --> 37:39.720
Eat.

37:43.520 --> 37:45.040
How do you know I'm hungry?

37:46.960 --> 37:49.120
You just fixed the Destiny Book
and got frightened.

37:49.200 --> 37:50.520
Then you fainted.

37:51.720 --> 37:53.120
You're useless.

37:54.800 --> 37:55.960
It tastes good.

38:03.280 --> 38:04.640
Where did you get this hairpin?

38:08.640 --> 38:09.760
Jieli lent it to me.

38:09.840 --> 38:11.440
It's nothing. It's worthless.

38:16.360 --> 38:17.280
What are you doing?

38:20.280 --> 38:22.200
You are the Moon Supreme.

38:22.280 --> 38:23.600
You have everything in the world.

38:23.680 --> 38:26.240
Why try to rob my stuff?

38:33.040 --> 38:35.920
This Heart-Hiding Hairpin
was made by Lady Yan,

38:36.000 --> 38:37.280
the founder of the Moon Tribe.

38:38.160 --> 38:40.360
How did it become your stuff?

38:45.840 --> 38:46.720
No.

38:46.800 --> 38:48.600
I'll return it later.

38:48.680 --> 38:50.000
If Jieli asks me to pay,

38:50.080 --> 38:51.760
I can't afford it.

38:55.640 --> 38:57.280
You can keep it,

38:58.280 --> 38:59.440
but you can't wear it.

39:00.280 --> 39:01.240
Take it off.

39:08.280 --> 39:09.240
No.

39:10.200 --> 39:11.920
- Why?
- It's nothing.

39:12.000 --> 39:12.840
Why?

39:12.920 --> 39:13.760
It's nothing.

39:13.840 --> 39:15.040
Why?

39:15.120 --> 39:16.120
Because…

39:19.960 --> 39:21.640
Because I don't want you to know

39:21.720 --> 39:22.880
what I'm thinking.

39:25.240 --> 39:27.600
I need to know what you are thinking

39:27.680 --> 39:29.160
so I can protect you in time.

39:29.240 --> 39:30.400
What's wrong with that?

39:30.480 --> 39:31.720
You almost lost your life

39:31.800 --> 39:33.320
because of this hairpin.

39:34.240 --> 39:35.800
Even so, I want to wear it.

39:35.880 --> 39:36.800
Anyway,

39:36.880 --> 39:39.040
you can't just come into my heart.

39:39.120 --> 39:41.280
It's like you can't just break into
someone else's house

39:41.360 --> 39:42.240
without permission.

39:45.040 --> 39:48.240
I can go wherever I want.

39:48.800 --> 39:50.120
I can have

39:50.200 --> 39:51.520
whatever I want.

39:52.560 --> 39:53.520
You…

39:56.960 --> 39:59.000
Anyway, I insist on this

39:59.080 --> 40:00.600
even though you are the Moon Supreme.

40:00.680 --> 40:02.120
Even if I'm in danger one day,

40:02.200 --> 40:03.480
you can't save me.

40:03.560 --> 40:04.800
People have secrets.

40:11.360 --> 40:13.840
But why was I allowed to do it
in the past?

40:13.920 --> 40:16.600
You didn't mind that
I knew what you were thinking.

40:16.680 --> 40:18.000
The past is the past.

40:18.080 --> 40:20.000
What's the difference now?
